---

<section id="contribute" class="hline">
  <div class="px-10 py-10 text-center">
    <h2 class="mb-1 text-[22px] font-bold tracking-tight">Contribute.</h2>
    <p
      class="mx-auto mb-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed"
      style="color: var(--muted); max-width: 420px;"
    >
      Add a source in ~100 lines. Implement the <code
        class="bg-white/[0.06] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px]">Source</code
      > interface, register it in <code class="bg-white/[0.06] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px]"
        >createSdk()</code
      >, and write a live E2E test.
    </p>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <a
        href="/docs/contributing/"
        class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold text-black transition-colors hover:bg-zinc-200"
      >
        Read the guide →
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/hexxt-git/anime-sdk"
        target="_blank"
        class="px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold transition-colors hover:text-white"
        style="color: var(--muted); border: 1px solid var(--border);"
      >
        GitHub ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
